sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant AC as AgentChatController
    participant AS as AgentChatServiceImpl
    participant G as AgentRunGate
    participant CS as AgentConversationService
    participant MP as AgentMemoryPipeline
    participant AP as ReActAgentProvider
    participant CAT as AgentToolCatalog
    participant RA as AgentScope ReActAgent
    participant ST as PgAgentStateStore
    participant KB as KnowledgeSearchFacade
    participant EB as AgentStreamEventBridge
    participant RH as AgentRunHandle
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>AC: GET /agent/v1/chat?question=...
    Note over AC: Controller 仅 engine.type=agent 时装配
    AC->>AS: streamChat(question, conversationId, emitter)
    AS->>G: acquire(user, task, conversation)
    alt 同用户已有运行中流
        G-->>User: ClientException（副作用前拒绝）
    else 获得运行位
        AS-->>User: META(conversationId, taskId)
        AS->>CS: touchConversation
        AS->>MP: ensureExtractionBaseline（若开启）
        AS->>CS: addUserMessage
        CS->>DB: Agent conversation + USER message
        AS->>RH: new handle + release hooks
        Note over RH: release gate → evict local state cache<br/>→ schedule memory extraction
        AS->>AP: getAgent()
        AP->>CAT: resolve catalog + fingerprint
        CAT-->>AP: knowledge / memory / MCP tool snapshot
        AP->>RA: cached or rebuilt ReActAgent
        AS->>EB: new bridge + register task
        AS->>RA: streamEvents(question, RuntimeContext)

        loop ReAct iterations
            RA-->>EB: thinking / text / tool / hint / result event
            EB-->>User: MESSAGE / TOOL / HINT
            alt Agent 选择 search_knowledge
                RA->>KB: search(query, recentTurns)
                KB->>KB: rewrite → KB intents → retrieve → synthesize
                KB-->>RA: evidence answer text
            else Agent 选择 MCP tool
                RA->>CAT: McpToolBridge → existing MCP executor
                CAT-->>RA: ToolResultBlock
            end
        end

        Note over RA,ST: PgAgentStateStore 是框架持久化适配边界<br/>AgentScope 具体 save/load 时点待依赖源码核验
        RA-->>ST: AgentScope 触发的 StateStore 调用（时点未在应用层确定）
        ST->>DB: opaque AgentScope JSON

        alt 正常完成
            RA-->>EB: onComplete
            EB->>CS: assistant=NORMAL + blocks
            CS->>DB: Agent assistant message
            EB-->>User: FINISH → DONE
            EB->>RH: complete(body)
        else 用户停止 / 连接终止
            AS->>RH: interruptUpstream<br/>dispose + agent.interrupt
            EB->>CS: 有正文/思考/Block时 assistant=INTERRUPTED
            EB-->>User: CANCEL → DONE
            EB->>RH: cancel(body)
        else Agent 流错误
            EB->>RH: fail(error)
            RH-->>User: fail emitter
            Note over EB,DB: 当前业务桥不保存 assistant 失败消息
        end

        RH->>RH: CAS 只允许一个终态
        RH->>AS: unregister task + run release hooks
        AS->>G: compareAndSet 释放自己的运行位
        AS->>AP: evictStateCache（仅当前节点）
        AS->>MP: 异步长期记忆抽取（若开启）
    end

    Note over RA,ST: 应用层不能单独证明框架在每个取消/异常时点都已成功保存 State，需依赖源码与运行证据
